EmberBSD local adaptation, AI-assisted, 2026-10-07; not submitted upstream.
Apply the one-line correction documented by Uli Schlachter (psychon) in:
https://github.com/awesomeWM/awesome/issues/3561
xcb_atom_name_by_screen appends _S<screen>, so the base must be WM.

--- a/awesome.c
+++ b/awesome.c
@@ -244,7 +244,7 @@
     xwindow_set_name_static(globalconf.selection_owner_window,
             "Awesome WM_Sn selection owner window");
 
-    atom_name = xcb_atom_name_by_screen("WM_S", globalconf.default_screen);
+    atom_name = xcb_atom_name_by_screen("WM", globalconf.default_screen);
     if(!atom_name)
         fatal("error getting WM_Sn atom name");
 
